{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1202818-template-modification-soulbound","id":1202818,"title":"Template Modification: Soulbound","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-03T17:56:46-07:00","id":1202818,"title":"Template Modification: Soulbound","content":"The following is a writeup of the mechanics enabled by the central Mystery of my current Mage campaign. I'm not going to detail what *caused* the phenomena because the player this was built around frequents the forums, but suffice it to say that this is meant to be an extremely rare, if not one-of-a-kind Condition.<br /> <br /> tl;dr, Soulbound are people (theoretically anyone, but this writeup is focused on Mages) that have each had their soul fused into a single whole. Possessing the Condition allows access to a wide variety of merits that permanently alter how it functions for both parties, and every Merit has a drawback. The Condition might as well be incurable, excepting death. Of note is that Soulbound don't necessarily have to <i>like</i> each other, or act in any sort of cooperative fashion...<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1e43wIzNAHTlmyhnwNcE58ZzPQpPKzBOdF1C3eZVRbsU/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3570,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","user":"lnodiv","date":". 04-03-2018, 09:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-06T12:20:07-07:00","id":1203939,"title":"","content":"Looks interesting. Still reading through, but the first thing that popped into my head after reading the line about Mages treating the other as Soul Stones...<br /> <br /> Can the other individual create/serve as a Demesne?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-06T19:30:05-07:00","id":1204073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1202818-template-modification-soulbound?p=1203939#post1203939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Looks interesting. Still reading through, but the first thing that popped into my head after reading the line about Mages treating the other as Soul Stones...<br /> Can the other individual create/serve as a Demesne?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, but the normal restrictions with relocating soul stones that are part of a Demesne apply, so this is of limited utility. Works decently in a pinch if you need one on the go, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-10T14:45:30-07:00","id":1205369,"title":"","content":"The potency of the drawbacks often negate the benefits of any given ability on your list","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23924-realmlord","name":"Realmlord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-11T05:29:07-07:00","id":1205547,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Realmlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1202818-template-modification-soulbound?p=1205369#post1205369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The potency of the drawbacks often negate the benefits of any given ability on your list</div> </div> </div> </div>Which ones? The only one with a very steep drawback is Twin Souls, which you can bypass by simply using a free slot on Arcane Tether. The Style merit is meant to be a capstone where the drawback is more easily avoided the more Soulbound merits you have.<br /> <br /> In actual play, we haven't noticed any issues so far, but both characters are pretty deep into the merits (5-8 dots ea).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}